Ready — [run] v0.16.1]([local file path omitted]).

The animation in the letter now comes from **the actual recording of Unreal**: cutting one link and physical motion of the puppet, processed into graphite contours and dashing. It preserves the face, costume and joint of the character.

The version also includes all previous amendments:

- shadow reproduction resistant to holding the button;
- **Menu → Reset progress**, with confirmation and a copy of the records;
- subtle murmurs in defeat;
- one audience entrance and a curtain between the files;
- props on a pedestal and double the head spin.

Checked in Windows, in EN/PL/FR. Previous versions, source recording and GlassBox preserved on [private GitHub](https://github.com/maciejmatyka/shadow-theatre/releases/tag/prototype-v0.16.1).

